  Alex from IT: I forwarded the audit trail. To everyone. Yes, including the board.
  Alex from IT: Every badge, every cable, every 3 AM packet. Meredith can claim ignorance. The logs cannot.
  Alex from IT: That's the thing about records. They don't care who wins.
  goto n73

  @n71
  set chat_alex_act6_seen
  goto n0

  @n72
  if chat_alex_act7_seen -> n5 else -> n68

