  @n77
  if act6_complete else -> n9
  if act7_complete -> n87 else -> n82
  # Act 6: the notes he kept for seven years

  @n79
  Isaiah: I started keeping a second set of notes after Merger Four. Not copies of work — observations. Who said what in what room on what day.
  Isaiah: I told myself it was just documentation practice.
  Isaiah: Seven years of practice. Turned out to be exactly what we needed.
  goto n88

  @n82
  if chat_isaiah_act6_seen -> n9 else -> n79
  # Act 7: the binder and what it means now

  @n83
  Isaiah: Eleven years. Eleven years of notes in a binder nobody asked for.
  Isaiah: For the first time since I started keeping them, I hope I never need them again.
  Andrew: Keep the binder.
  Isaiah: I'm going to keep the binder.
