  @n92
  if act6_complete else -> n13
  if act7_complete -> n102 else -> n97
  # Act 6: sixty-three pages, twice

  @n94
  Diane: I read the whole restructuring packet last night. All sixty-three pages. Twice.
  Diane: Meredith isn't wrong that the department is inefficient. She's wrong about what that means. Inefficiency in trust work is sometimes just called — being thorough.
  Diane: Page forty-seven of the original charter. I've bookmarked it for you.
  goto n103

  @n97
  if chat_diane_act6_seen -> n13 else -> n94
  # Act 7: the post-restructuring review form

  @n98
